{"candidateAnswer":"Around late August 2023","evidence":"[D13:1 | 3:31 pm on 23 August, 2023] Caroline: Hi Melanie! Hope you're doing good. Guess what I did this week? I took the first step towards becoming a mom - I applied to adoption agencies! It's a big decision, but I think I'm ready to give all my love to a child. I got lots of help from this adoption advice/assistance group I attended. It was great!","itemId":"urn:uuid:63758f24-f67b-53fe-ba28-42d86a47fa2a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d6b27ccfe5d9b1d730d519c1384019e2cd9f474b5f5c0fac719c24123c04481c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Caroline apply to adoption agencies?","referenceAnswer":"The week of 23 August 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d6b27ccfe5d9b1d730d519c1384019e2cd9f474b5f5c0fac719c24123c04481c"}}]}